otp_scheduler_process: "OTP learning: scheduler-process / Gambit context and root graph are not an isolated Erlang process heap"
otp_native_exit: "OTP learning: native-exit / Unknown native Gambit writers may reach shared movable graphs"
otp_reader_grace: "OTP learning: reader-grace / External C callers cannot promise scheduler event-loop progress automatically"
otp_actor_memory: "OTP learning: actor-memory / Actor API resemblance supplies neither heap isolation nor barriers for mutable shared data or continuations"
otp_scheduler_process -> origin_task_claim: separation lesson
otp_reader_grace -> teardown_reclamation: unmanaged readers excluded
otp_native_exit -> withdrawal_custody: logical exit differs from native stop
otp_actor_memory -> frozen_root_publication: shared Scheme semantics require own proof
